WEBVTT

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.910
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold
in Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.980
Mitsuha Plays the Part!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:43.190
Excuse me!

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:44.500
Yes, what is it?

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:47.870
Is this the estate of Count Bozes?

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:49.880
Yes, that's right.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.620
I'd like to speak with the count.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:58.760
Do you happen to have an engagement 
or a letter of invitation?

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.790
Nope, I don't.

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:03.390
Then we can't allow you to pass.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.780
I'm sorry, but please take your leave.

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.510
Figures.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.750
No way they'd let me meet him 
without an appointment.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:14.700
Hmm?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.220
What was that carriage?

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.310
They're sons of the count.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:31.510
At times, they come out 
to survey the domain like so.

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.460
How admirable.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.500
Hmm, hmm...

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:37.210
I see.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.830
There are two kinds of people in this world.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.720
Those who wait for chances, 
and those who create them!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.280
And of course I'm...

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:55.370
They need to pass through here 
to return to the count's manor.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.110
So slow...

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.300
They're here!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.380
Whoa, whoa!

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:22.740
<i>Now!</i>

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:26.350
Eek!

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:28.560
What?

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:30.090
What's wrong?!

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.500
Brother, a person!

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.290
Are you all right?!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.730
She's passed out!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.190
Quickly, bring her to the manor!

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:44.160
<i>Into the count's manor I go!</i>

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.120
A carriage of ours struck someone?!

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.370
<i>Infiltration successful!</i>

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.990
So how is her condition?

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:58.210
She doesn't appear to have any injuries...

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.580
We must make sure that's 
the case! Get a doctor!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.580
Yes, sir.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.260
That won't be needed.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.050
Oh, you've come to?

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:10.800
I'm the lord of this land. 
Claus, the Count of Bozes.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:14.210
My apologies for 
the misconduct of my carriage.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.800
<i>These people seem as nice as the rumors!</i>

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:20.940
<i>Lucky!</i>

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.300
Oh, no...

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:26.370
I should be thanking you for 
so graciously nursing me back to health.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.550
Are you really feeling better?

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.590
Yes, and I have you to thank.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.450
I see. How splendid.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.890
Perhaps this was fate at work.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:37.920
Please allow me to properly 
introduce myself at a later time.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.330
Yes, by all means.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.920
Until then.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.910
<i>Okay, almost time for battle!</i>

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:53.080
So that's when I told him...

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.130
Please enter.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.660
Oh!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:07.120
I come from the distant nation of Japan.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.760
My name is Mitsuha von Yamano.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.380
<i>Elegant attire I've not seen before.</i>

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.240
<i>So she really is a noble 
from a foreign country.</i>

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:18.810
<i>However...</i>

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.280
My apologies. Please take a seat.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.380
You appear to be alone, Lady Mitsuha.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.300
What brings you to this town?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:31.410
Oh, yes. We were attacked 
by wild animals in my travels,

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.170
and not only was I separated 
from the others,

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:37.080
but my life was in danger when 
the people of this land saved me.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:42.990
Filled with gratitude, I thought to inform 
the lord of the goodwill of his subjects,

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:45.160
so I had made my way to this town.

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:47.030
My word! Can it be true?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:52.490
<i>A foreigner... a frail young lady 
at that, saved by my subjects,</i>

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:55.840
<i>and retelling the story 
in front of my children!</i>

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.460
<i>What a wonderfully pleasing development!</i>

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:04.960
In fact, I had paid a visit earlier, 
but I wasn't permitted inside.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.910
Why, that's the pinnacle of discourtesy!

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.090
Stefan! Who was on guard duty today?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.090
Please wait.

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:15.990
I'm at fault for suddenly intruding 
with nothing to my name.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.210
Your guards only did their rightful duty.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.560
Why, I'd say they're worthy of praise!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.070
I-If you insist, Lady Mitsuha.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.300
<i>She's of a tender age,</i>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.490
<i>yet how modest and understanding she is!</i>

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.060
<i>That move just now must have 
hugely boosted his affection for me!</i>

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.470
<i>So let's go ahead and...</i>

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:40.360
It's not much, but I have an article 
brought from my native land.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:44.960
I'd be happy if you would accept it 
as a token of my gratitude.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.220
Wh-What's this now?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.680
It's a multipurpose folding knife.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.970
What?! You say this is a knife?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.110
Yes.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:07:00.390
S-Such precise craftsmanship! How stunning.

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:03.110
I must repay you in some way.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.730
Lady Mitsuha, what are your plans after this?

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:10.570
Ah, yes, I planned on directly 
setting out for the royal capital.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.810
That won't do! It'll soon grow dark!

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.550
I simply won't allow it!

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:16.870
Y-Yes!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.590
It just so happens that there's a carriage 
headed for the royal capital tomorrow morning.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.120
Please take that instead.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.040
Hmm?

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.490
I'm ashamed to admit it,

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:31.800
but with my meager travel allowance, 
I can't afford the carriage fee...

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.340
<i>What? No money for a carriage?</i>

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.930
<i>Despite what seems like premium apparel?</i>

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:43.040
<i>After giving as thanks an item that would 
fetch dozens of gold if sold to a noble?</i>

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:47.360
That's right... you said you were 
separated from your companions.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.410
They must have taken care 
of the travel expenses.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.450
Yes...

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.020
Please, do stay the night here.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:56.660
We can discuss your circumstances 
in greater detail later.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.490
Thank you very much.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.140
<i>Just who in the world is she?</i>

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.280
<i>I've won!</i>

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.190
<i>Starting today, my name is Mitsuha!</i>

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.520
<i>Not Yamano Mitsuha, but Mitsuha von Yamano!</i>

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.800
<i>Daughter of an esteemed family 
from a foreign nation!</i>

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:29.070
<i>And hiding my noble birth, I'll live 
in this country as a commoner,</i>

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.070
<i>playing the part of the brave girl Mitsuha!</i>

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.950
<i>No, I'll become her!</i>

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.910
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.960
<b>Saving 80,000 Gold in
Another World 
for My Retirement</b>

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.270
Lady Yamano, this way.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.290
Yes.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:54.300
Thank you very much 
for inviting me into your home.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.450
Y-Yes, we bid you welcome.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.760
Let me formally welcome you 
to the Bozes estate.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.340
This is a family gathering.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:06.520
Don't worry about manners or decorous 
language and enjoy yourself at ease.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.400
Understood.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.560
Now, then. It's a little late, 
but allow me to introduce my family.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.020
This is my wife, Iris.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.530
And my eldest son.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.520
M-My name is Alexis! I'm 17 years old!

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.580
<i>What a shame. He's younger than me!</i>

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.540
My second son, Theodore, 15.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.100
And my youngest and only 
daughter, Beatrice, 13.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.040
Feel free to ask me anything 
as you would an older sister.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:35.060
<i>Older sister?! Do I really 
look younger than 13?</i>

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:41.220
<i>W-Well... I guess it makes sense...</i>

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:49.530
<i>In this world, even aristocratic 
meals taste this bad...</i>

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.570
Ah, Lady Mitsuha.

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:03.370
Y-Yes?!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.620
No, I don't mean to bite your head off.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.300
Please relax.

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:09.540
Y-Yes...

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.380
Just who, exactly, are you?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.250
I'd like an honest answer if it's possible.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:17.170
<i>Here it is!</i>

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.220
The part about being 
from a different country is true.

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:27.190
I gave you my family name earlier,

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:32.150
but now that I've left my country, my rank 
or position in my homeland mean nothing.

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.900
The reason I left my country...

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.060
I suppose you could call it 
a succession dispute.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:41.660
It all began when my father 
passed away from an illness.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.300
What of your mother or siblings?

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:47.290
My mother had already 
passed away several years ago.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.330
Oh, dear...

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:52.870
The only ones left were my kind, 
wise younger brother and myself.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.280
I believe it's only natural 
that my brother be the successor,

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:01.220
but there were those who insisted 
that I take power instead.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:04.330
Once the daughter succeeds her father,

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.850
then impose one's own son upon her 
to usurp her family fortune...

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:10.240
An all-too-common tale.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.100
So that's why you're on your current journey?

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.100
Yes.

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:17.420
I left a note, but I knew 
I'd be forcibly returned if I were found,

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:19.980
so I hurried onto a boat 
and came to this country.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:22.360
All I've brought with me 
are a few personal effects...

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.950
along with this necklace 
as a memento of my mother.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.410
I see...

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:32.040
And so, I've made up my mind!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.420
I'll earn a living in this country,

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.380
and live an honest life on my own!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.970
Truly splendid, Lady Mitsuha!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.340
<i>Nailed it!</i>

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.640
If I sell this necklace, it should 
be enough to serve as a bankroll...

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.320
D-Did you say sell it?!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.180
Yes?!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.690
Do you have any idea what that is?!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:53.450
Ah, yes.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:57.130
These are genuine pearls, so they 
should fetch a decent price.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.580
Are you saying these are imitations?

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.400
I don't believe it!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:05.030
You see, pearls vary greatly in their value.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.700
And that necklace!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:10.540
They're in the largest category, 
and boast perfect shape and deep color!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:14.010
And what's with all 
of those matching pearls?!

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.700
It's not just one or two!

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.810
You've got enough to make a whole necklace!

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.560
That should be impossible!

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:24.180
I simply cannot believe it!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:32.740
Er... if you'd like to have it, Lady Iris...

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:34.020
What?!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.350
I-Iris. What would 
the market price for that be?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:39.760
Eek!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.280
Market price? There's no such thing!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:45.280
It's a one-of-a-kind treasure 
that shouldn't exist in this world!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.280
An item out of a dream whose owner 
is sure to leave one's mark in history!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.710
Any king or person wealthy enough would 
do anything to get their hands on it!

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.700
So if you put it up for auction...

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:58.100
A senseless move!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.840
It'd spark a chain of theft and murder,

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.840
and those involved would soon go missing!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.780
<i>Yikes! That's worse than I thought!</i>

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:09.980
<i>Looks like a cultured pearl necklace 
was going way overboard.</i>

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:14.510
<i>I figured it'd be cheap on Earth 
and expensive here...</i>

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:19.470
<i>But I should have picked something cheaper 
than the priciest ones at 1,300,000 yen,</i>

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:22.390
<i>or maybe gemstones instead...</i>

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:26.940
<i>But if word of this gets out by mistake, 
it'll cause a lot of headaches...</i>

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.770
<i>That's why I wanted to have 
the count's family hold on to it,</i>

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:31.140
<i>so it never hits the market.</i>

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:36.380
<i>The plan was to have him provide future 
funds and support in exchange...</i>

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:42.760
Lady Iris, then couldn't we take 
the necklace apart to sell the pearls?

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:45.060
Take this priceless treasure apart?!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.590
Are you picking a fight with the gods?!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:50.220
<i>Yikes! What do you want me 
to do then, lady?!</i>

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.760
<i>Whatever, the gloves are off!</i>

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.420
Then what should I do?

00:13:55.420 --> 00:14:01.760
What I need now is not a beautiful 
necklace that serves no use,

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.940
but money so I can survive!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.860
You do have a point there...

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:11.450
So I'd like Lady Iris to take this after all!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.700
S-Such a sum of money...

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.900
Hmm...

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:20.420
All I need is enough money 
to start a shop in the royal capital.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.210
The rest I'll work hard to earn!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.500
Mitsuha, you...

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:28.220
<i>Okay, time to use the ol' tearjerker classic!</i>

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:32.060
I'd like for you to have it, Lady Iris.

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.260
You see...

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:38.140
Something about you reminds me 
of my kind, late mother...

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.730
Mitsuha!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:42.660
Yes?

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.520
<i>This could work!</i>

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:51.690
Thank you so much 
for thinking of me that way!

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.200
Lady Iris...

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:57.650
<i>I ended up taking advantage 
of this nice family,</i>

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:59.630
<i>but we both benefit from this arrangement...</i>

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.140
<i>So it's fine, right?</i>

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.360
Let us adjourn this conversation for now.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:10.350
Now, why don't you all join in, as well?

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:11.150
Yes!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.990
Oh, Mitsuha...

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:18.050
Your beautiful black hair 
and mysterious obsidian eyes...

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:21.760
Miraculous hues that the Goddess 
has blessed you alone with!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:26.130
Oh, in my country, almost everyone's 
hair and eyes are these colors.

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.380
Eh...

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.820
Mitsuha, that multipurpose knife is amazing!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.110
Do you have anything else?

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.740
I have a regular folding knife, as well.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.270
M-Mitsuha!

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:42.250
Huh? Ah...

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.230
<i>Oh no! Not only did I 
unknowingly strike a sexy pose,</i>

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:47.300
<i>but I brought a weapon 
to an aristocratic dinner table!</i>

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.340
<i>They must be doubly taken aback!</i>

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.890
Are the knife arts not 
common in this country?

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:54.840
Knife arts?

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:56.380
Yes.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:59.390
In my country, a proper lady 
is versed in the knife arts.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:03.730
All women carry a knife like this 
for protection at all times.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.210
I-Is that right?

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.730
What a fascinating culture.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.610
<i>Okay, they let it pass!</i>

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:13.570
It's got a sharp edge, so please be careful.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:15.950
Wow!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.480
You can have it if you'd like.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.430
What?!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.990
It's for protection, but I have another.

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:23.620
How does one gold for it sound?

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.130
I-I'll buy it!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:28.640
<i>Going off the information 
I got during dinner,</i>

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:33.780
<i>I figure 1 gold has about the same 
monetary value as 100,000 Japanese yen...</i>

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:37.470
<i>It's less than 10 times what 
it cost, so it's a fair price!</i>

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.410
Mitsuha, is that it?

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.520
Do you have anything else?

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.850
I'm sorry.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:46.980
I left my luggage with my companions, 
so I don't really have much else on hand...

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:49.110
A change of underwear's all I've got.

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.670
I'll take it!

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.390
Alexis, you...

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:53.780
Brother Alex...

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.250
Ah...

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.080
That'll be five silver!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.290
You'll sell it?!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.660
One small gold coin...

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.150
Eh?!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:08.450
Mitsuha.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:09.290
Yes?

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:10.700
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:16.490
<i>S-She's only 13? 
What a frightening child!</i>

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.120
You're starting a shop in the capital?

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.640
What kind of shop?

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.560
Huh? Well, you see...

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.450
I was thinking of opening a general store.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.480
A general store?

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:27.990
Selling various small articles, 
cosmetics, accessories...

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:32.010
As well as some practical items 
that women would want!

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:34.290
Wow, that sounds interesting!

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:35.610
<i>That reminds me...</i>

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:38.910
<i>The food in this world is pretty bad.</i>

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.210
To live is to eat!

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:45.420
In other words, the way to a man's 
heart is through his stomach!

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:47.210
Yeah! That's right!

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:50.510
Also, I was thinking of selling food!

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.120
Food, you say?

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.780
That might be harder than you think.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:57.060
What does that mean?

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.780
In recent years, though 
there's no clear cause,

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:03.560
the yield of wheat and crops 
has been decreasing.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:07.410
Isn't that either the impact of continuous 
cultivation or a lack of fertilizer?

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.270
Huh?

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:12.710
Growing the same crops over 
and over depletes the soil.

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:16.280
That's why you need to plant 
other crops and rotate the soil!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.440
<i>That's what Onii-chan said!</i>

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:22.740
* Home garden

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:21.740
Taste my home-grown veggies!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:24.660
I see...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.890
You can fertilize the soil 
with mulch or manure!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.850
Uh-huh...

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:33.290
Next, you develop a specialty product!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.000
Things you can only grow on Bozes land,

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.930
as well as those of staggeringly 
higher quality than your competitors'!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:39.930
Establish your brand!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:43.000
Raising tax rates will lead 
to less total revenue!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.600
Also, inventions!

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:47.790
A single invention 
and you could be raking it in!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.940
Let's think of an idea for an invention!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:55.150
Oh, when I talk with you, 
it's so fun I simply lose track of time!

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:59.640
No, that's really not true!

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:00.360
Ah!

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.990
Oh, how careless of you.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.910
How typical of Mitsuha!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:09.180
Oh, don't say that, Dad, Mom...

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:10.330
Ah...

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.550
Well? Isn't this a great idea?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:18.660
When I talk with you, it's so fun 
I simply lose track of time!

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.300
Here, it's nice and cold.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.400
Ah, yeah, I'll have some!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.880
Oh, how careless of you.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:29.430
Typical Mitsuha!

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:32.650
<i>Dad...</i>

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:35.510
<i>Mom...</i>

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.110
<i>Onii-chan...</i>

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.870
<i>Why did I mix them up?</i>

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.560
<i>I was having so much fun...</i>

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.890
<i>I didn't cry then...</i>

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:53.140
<i>I managed to hold it in back then...</i>

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:57.840
Mitsuha.

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.090
Mitsuha...

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:03.300
It's fine. It's fine...

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.470
It's fine if you call me Father...

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.920
Think of me as your mother, as well.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:34.790
Thank you so much for everything, 
all of you of the Bozes family.

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:37.880
<i>Please forget about last night.</i>

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:42.070
<i>Well, I gained the trust 
of the count and countess,</i>

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.050
<i>so it all worked out in the end.</i>

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:46.870
<i>I'm sure they'll be of help 
in the future, too.</i>

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:50.380
Mitsuha, please do watch your health.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.520
And be wary of strange men.

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.320
Thank you very much, Lady Iris.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:59.070
<i>I got plenty of practice with Lord Alexis.</i>

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:03.200
We'll visit the royal capital soon, when 
the season for social functions is upon us.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.450
So wait for us!

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:05.920
<i>Sure...</i>

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:08.810
Tell us more about your country next time!

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:11.080
I'll tell you all the best 
restaurants in the capital!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.470
Yes! I look forward to the day 
we meet again.

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:20.410
I have here a letter instructing that they 
prepare as much money as you need.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:21.340
So rest assured.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:24.940
Understood.

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:27.470
Thank you for going so far 
as to provide me with attendants.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:31.140
<i>Though I really would have 
preferred to travel alone.</i>

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.930
<i>Well, it's fine.</i>

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.720
Then, please have yourself a safe journey.

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:36.650
I will!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:42.360
<i>To the royal capital!</i>

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:47.200
<i>My chest is swelling with excitement 
at the new life that awaits me!</i>

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:48.660
<i>Well...</i>

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.760
<i>it still looks exactly the same.</i>
